{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key of the document whose header is being recorded."}]}],"name":"docKey"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The serialized header."}]}],"name":"bytes"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It leaves the snapshot alone – an online client syncs constantly, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-snapshotting per sync would reintroduce the cost this interface exists to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"avoid – and it leaves the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"log"}]},{"type":"text","text":" alone too."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That second part is load-bearing. The log does two jobs: it holds un-pushed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes so they survive a reload, and it is the delta between the snapshot and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the document’s current content. Deleting acknowledged entries serves the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"job and destroys the second, because nothing brings the snapshot forward on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"push-ack – the content would then exist in neither place while the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"serverSeq"},{"type":"text","text":" claims the server has it. Only compaction trims the log, and it does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so by folding the entries into a new snapshot first."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The header itself carries the acknowledged "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientSeq"},{"type":"text","text":", so a restore reads it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from there; the store needs no separate parameter for it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a no-op when nothing is stored for the key."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the underlying storage raises."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the post-sync header."}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","externalID":"s:6Yorkie8DocStoreP8saveMeta6docKey5bytesySS_10Foundation4DataVtYaKF","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"required":true},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Yorkie","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the post-sync header."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)","required":true,"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","type":"topic"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"DocStore","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore"}}}